its own legal contract and payment.

For actual runs keep separate

$$
\begin{aligned}
c_A(u)&=(q_A(u),a_A(u),\ell_A(u)),&
\ell_A(u)&=\sum_{\text{actual reads at }p}|p|,\\
b(A)&=(\sup_Dq_A,\sup_Da_A,\sup_D\ell_A),&
